  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UCCPA- Djougou Cashew Promotion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Cashew.Beneficiaries: 558 (81 Women).Description: The project will promote group sales of cashews by producers, including construction of warehouses, provision of transport, and training to improve plantation management and the marketing, financial, and administrative capacity of the union.</narrative>
